  CVE-2025-70067|2026-05-04T14:16:29.350|2026-05-05T16:16:10.577|9.8|CRITICAL|CWE-122|N/A|false|Buffer Overflow vulnerability exists in Assimp versions up to 6.0.2 in the FBX Importer. The vulnerability occurs in aiMaterial::AddBinaryProperty, where a property key string from a crafted FBX file is copied into a fixed-size heap buffer using strcpy() without runtime length validation|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-70067|0.00017|0.04061|6.8605
