  CVE-2026-7740|2026-05-04T07:16:02.257|2026-05-04T15:17:58.710|1.9|LOW|CWE-404|N/A|false|A security vulnerability has been detected in justdan96 tsMuxer up to 2.7.0. This issue affects the function VvcVpsUnit::setFPS of the file tsMuxer/vvc.cpp. Such manipulation of the argument track_id leads to denial of service. An attack has to be approached locally. The exploit has been disclosed publicly and may be used. This vulnerability only affects products that are no longer supported by the maintainer.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-7740|0.00013|0.02061|1.3304
